IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. BROWSER-CLEAN-SIM.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  FILE-NAME           PIC X(20) VALUE "COOKIES.DB".
01  STATUS-CODE         PIC X(2) VALUE "00".
01  ITERATION            PIC 9(2) VALUE 0.
PROCEDES.
    DISPLAY "DEBUT DU PROCESSUS DE PURGE...".
    PERFORM VARYING ITERATION FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL ITERATION > 5
        DISPLAY "ANALYSE DU FICHIER : " FILE-NAME
        DISPLAY "VERIFICATION DES VERROUILS... OK"
        DISPLAY "EXECUTION SQL: DELETE FROM COOKIES WHERE EXPIRY < NOW"
        DISPLAY "ENTREE TRAITEE : " ITERATION
    END-PERFORM.
    DISPLAY "FIN DU PROCESSUS. INTEGRITE VERIFIEE.".
    STOP RUN.